Derived work
================================================================================
The UPI engine in lib/upi/ (QR parser, UPI 123Pay dial-string builder, bank-SMS
parser and the payment-session invariant) is a TypeScript port of code from
Flowpay — Payments Without Internet
https://github.com/Flowpayup/Payments-Without-Internet
Copyright 2026 Flowpay. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Modifications: ported from Kotlin to TypeScript, added rail routing for
Jio/dual-SIM, upi:// intent builder, and browser/native bridge.

LiquidPay is not affiliated with Flowpay, NPCI, any bank or any telecom
operator. "UPI", "UPI 123PAY" and "*99#" are referenced descriptively.

